OL,3,GNEWSATown still recovering from Storm
OL,4,ABert two years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe effects of Storm Bert are still
OL,7,Fbeing felt in a Wiltshire town two
OL,8,Fyears after it was hit by flooding,
OL,9,Fwith its Scout group on the hunt for a
OL,10,Fpermanent location and a homeless
OL,11,Fcharity now kitted out with defences.
OL,13,FThe River Avon, which runs through
OL,14,FChippenham, flooded the town centre in
OL,15,FNovember 2024.
OL,17,FBusinesses, community groups and
OL,18,Fcharities in the centre were all
OL,19,Funderwater and a clean-up operation
OL,20,Fimmediately swung into action but the
OL,21,Feffects of the storm left their mark on
OL,22,Fthe town.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
